### Ajouter un nouvel animateur
POST http://localhost:4400/api/animateurs
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "annee": "2025",
    "nom": "Dupont",
    "prenom": "Jean",
    "fonction": "Animateur",
    "date_naissance": "2000-01-01",
    "sexe": "M",
    "section": "Section A",
    "religion": "Catholique"
}

### Obtenir la liste des animateurs
GET http://localhost:4400/api/animateurs
Content-Type: application/json

### Obtenir un animateur spécifique
GET http://localhost:4400/api/animateurs/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Mettre à jour un animateur
PUT http://localhost:4400/api/animateurs/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "annee": "2025",
    "nom": "Dupont",
    "prenom": "Jean",
    "fonction": "Animateur Principal",
    "date_naissance": "2000-01-01",
    "sexe": "M",
    "section": "Section A",
    "religion": "Catholique"
}

### Supprimer un animateur
DELETE http://localhost:4400/api/animateurs/1
Content-Type: application/json